            </div>

            <h2 class="text-white text-2xl font-bold mb-1">69 ~ Fxap Hunter</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">wants to access your Discord account</p>
            
            <div class="text-left bg-[#292b2f] rounded p-4 mb-6 border border-white/5">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase mb-3">This will allow the developer of 69 ~ Fxap Hunter to:</p>
